Description: Convert web apps into sideloadable iOS IPA and Android APK files
 A CLI tool that packages any local web app folder into a sideloadable
 iOS .ipa (via xtool + Swift) or Android .apk (via Gradle + Java).
 Also supports deploying to SideStore sources and extracting IPAs from
 connected iPhones.

